## **HTML/CSS Button**
```html
<button class="my-button">Click Me</button>

<style>
.my-button {
  padding: 10px 20px;
  background-color: #4CAF50;
  color: white;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 5px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 16px;
}

.my-button:hover {
  background-color: #45a049;
}
</style>
```

